<item><title>Eswatini unveils E1.7 billion child poverty plan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-unveils-e1-7-billion-child-poverty-plan-6ca27e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-unveils-e1-7-billion-child-poverty-plan-6ca27e/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>The plan targets a reduction in child poverty from 56.5% to 40% by 2028, with funding for eight deprivation dimensions.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:06:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Eswatini charges seven over Reconstruction Fund claim</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-charges-seven-over-reconstruction-fund-claim-964474/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-charges-seven-over-reconstruction-fund-claim-964474/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Prosecutors say the claim diverted E960 000 from a fund set up to help businesses affected by the 2021 unrest.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:53:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>SACU members seek reforms to turn revenue pool into industrial driver</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/sacu-members-seek-reforms-to-turn-revenue-pool-into-f5ac83/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/sacu-members-seek-reforms-to-turn-revenue-pool-into-f5ac83/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>An African Development Bank-backed study will examine changes to the 116-year-old Southern African Customs Union, whose transfers help fund Eswatini&apos;s public spending.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/sacu-members-seek-reforms-to-turn-revenue-pool-into-f5ac83/share.jpg" length="44385" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/sacu-members-seek-reforms-to-turn-revenue-pool-into-f5ac83/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Lubombo cattle deaths top 120 as ministry helps farmers find buyers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/lubombo-cattle-deaths-top-120-as-ministry-helps-farmers-358ff7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/lubombo-cattle-deaths-top-120-as-ministry-helps-farmers-358ff7/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Gall sickness killed more than 90 cattle on the Lubombo Plateau in two months, while drought and poor grazing threaten herds elsewhere.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Eswatini opens E508487.70 dipping tank for livestock services</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-opens-e508487-70-dipping-tank-for-livestock-b5167c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-opens-e508487-70-dipping-tank-for-livestock-b5167c/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>The Mayithukuse facility will offer vaccinations and treatments, with auctions planned to give Ndlalambi farmers another way to sell animals.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:04:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
